  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>contiguity-weights-vertex-topology · 7×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1792 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-ward-regions-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"81\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"4\"></rect><rect x=\"101\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"5\"></rect><rect x=\"121\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"6\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-ward-regions-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const ringOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; ringOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const polygonOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; polygonOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const featureOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; featureOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const vertexHighOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; vertexHigh: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const vertexLowOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; vertexLow: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const vertexPolygonOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"18\">@group(0) @binding(6) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; vertexPolygon: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const vertexNextOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"20\">@group(0) @binding(7) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; vertexNext: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const RING_COUNT: u32 = 136u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">const POLYGON_COUNT: u32 = 136u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">const FEATURE_COUNT: u32 = 136u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">fn isFiniteFloat(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">// The snap key shared with the coverage operators: getSnapOrigin() (the first ring-owned vertex,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">// 0 when it is not finite) and quantise(value, origin). Keys are formed from the offset to\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">// the origin, so they depend on the extent of the data and not on its distance from the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">// coordinate origin (an absolute key x / tolerance passes 2^31 for coordinates in the millions\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">// with a millimetre tolerance), and from 2^23 steps the integer quotient is used as it is,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">// because adding 0.5 there rounds an odd step to the next even one.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">const SNAP_TOLERANCE: f32 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">const SNAP_MAXIMUM_STEPS: f32 = 16777216.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">fn getSnapOrigin() -&gt; vec2f {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  let firstVertex = ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  if (firstVertex &gt;= ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + 136u] ||\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">      firstVertex &gt;= (arrayLength(&amp;positions) - positionsOffset) / 2u) { return vec2f(0.0); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  let first = vec2f(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * firstVertex], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * firstVertex + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  return select(vec2f(0.0), first, isFiniteFloat(first.x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(first.y));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">fn quantise(value: f32, origin: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  if (SNAP_TOLERANCE &lt;= 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">    return bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(select(value, 0.0, value == 0.0));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let steps = (value - origin) / SNAP_TOLERANCE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let rounded = select(floor(steps + 0.5), steps, abs(steps) &gt;= 8388608.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  return bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(i32(clamp(rounded, -2147483520.0, 2147483520.0))) ^ 0x80000000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">fn isSnapRangeExceeded(value: f32, origin: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  return SNAP_TOLERANCE &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; abs((value - origin) / SNAP_TOLERANCE) &gt;= SNAP_MAXIMUM_STEPS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"60\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"61\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  _ = &amp;ringOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  _ = &amp;polygonOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  _ = &amp;featureOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  _ = &amp;vertexHigh;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  _ = &amp;vertexLow;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  _ = &amp;vertexPolygon;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  _ = &amp;vertexNext;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  var ring = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  var high = RING_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  while (ring + 1u &lt; high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">    let middle = (ring + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">    if (ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= index) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">      ring = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">      high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  var polygon = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  high = POLYGON_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  while (polygon + 1u &lt; high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    let middle = (polygon + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    if (polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= ring) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">      polygon = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">      high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  var feature = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  high = FEATURE_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  while (feature + 1u &lt; high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">    let middle = (feature + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">    if (featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= polygon) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">      feature = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">      high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  let x = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  let y = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  let ringBegin = ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + ring];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">  let ringEnd = ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + ring + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  let valid = index &gt;= ringBegin &amp;&amp; index &lt; ringEnd &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">    ring &gt;= polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset] &amp;&amp; ring &lt; polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + POLYGON_COUNT] &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">    ring &lt; polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + polygon + 1u] &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">    polygon &gt;= featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset] &amp;&amp; polygon &lt; featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset + FEATURE_COUNT] &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">    polygon &lt; featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset + feature + 1u] &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">    isFiniteFloat(x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  let origin = getSnapOrigin();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  vertexHigh[vertexHighOffset + index] = select(4294967295u, quantise(x, origin.x), valid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  vertexLow[vertexLowOffset + index] = select(4294967295u, quantise(y, origin.y), valid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  vertexPolygon[vertexPolygonOffset + index] = select(4294967295u, feature, valid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">  vertexNext[vertexNextOffset + index] = select(index + 1u, ringBegin, index + 1u == ringEnd);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"vertices\">vertices</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>ringOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"ringOffsets\">ringOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>polygonOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"polygonOffsets\">polygonOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>featureOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"featureOffsets\">featureOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>vertexHigh<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"contiguity-weights-vertex-high\">contiguity-weights-vertex-high</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>vertexLow<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"contiguity-weights-vertex-low\">contiguity-weights-vertex-low</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>vertexPolygon<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"contiguity-weights-vertex-feature\">contiguity-weights-vertex-feature</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>vertexNext<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"contiguity-weights-vertex-next\">contiguity-weights-vertex-next</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUContiguityWeights/vertex-topology · main · ed64aa35</figcaption></figure></section>",
